<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="pre-raid-best-in-slot">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_hammer_17.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Pre-Raid Best in Slot for Enhancement Shamans</span></h2>This is an example of the best-in-slot gear from all PvE sources available before entering a raid. While this gear may technically be the best available without raiding, it is unlikely that you will have or need all of these items before entering your first raid, and as you gain raid gear, your priorities will shift.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<div class="clear exclude-units"></div>
<div class="tabs-wrapper exclude-units uniform-width">
<div id="dsf67g4d-bis-lists">
<div class="tabs-container">
<div class="tabs" role="tablist">
<button aria-selected="true" data-href="#bis-lists-phase-3-pre-raid-bis" data-selected="true" role="tab" tabindex="0">
<div>
<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_legendary_chimeraoffear.jpg");'></span>Phase 3 Pre-Raid BiS</div></button>
<div class="vertical-scroll-shadow"></div>
<div class="horizontal-scroll-shadow"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="tabbed-contents">
<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-phase-3-pre-raid-bis" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents the best overall gear available from the next wave of Celestial dungeons in Mists of Pandaria Classic, world bosses, and new crafted items.<br/>
<br/>
