<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Enhancement Shamans</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings with it a whole lot of world content with the chance to drop powerful gear. This includes World Bosses such, as <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a>, <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=62346/galleon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Galleon</span></a>, <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=69099/nalak">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Nalak</span></a> and <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=69161/oondasta">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Oondasta</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="nalak">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_nature_wispsplode.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Nalak</span></h3>Nalak replaces Sha of Anger in terms of relevant item drops. You can get 2 pieces of your Tier 15 set, including <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95321/gloves-of-the-witch-doctor">
<img alt="Gloves of the Witch Doctor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_mail_raidshaman_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of the Witch Doctor</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95323/kilt-of-the-witch-doctor">
<img alt="Kilt of the Witch Doctor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_mail_raidshaman_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kilt of the Witch Doctor</span></a>. Additionaly the loot pool again includes some Tyrannical Gladiator's Gear and the Mount <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95057/reins-of-the-thundering-cobalt-cloud-serpent">
<img alt="Reins of the Thundering Cobalt Cloud Serpent" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pandarenserpentmount_lightning_blue.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reins of the Thundering Cobalt Cloud Serpent</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="oondasta">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_hunter_pet_devilsaur.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Oondasta</span></h3>Oondasta drops a lot of very strong 522 item level gear, which for the most part will be part of your Pre-Raid BiS and will even replace some old Tier 14 offpieces. The most interesting drops for Enhancement Shamans are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95179/necklace-of-the-hazillosaurus">
<img alt="Necklace of the Hazillosaurus" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_125.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Necklace of the Hazillosaurus</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95149/gorgoraptor-scale-chest">
<img alt="Gorgoraptor Scale Chest" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_raidhunter_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gorgoraptor Scale Chest</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95189/belt-of-the-dying-diemetradon">
<img alt="Belt of the Dying Diemetradon" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_mail_raidhunter_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Dying Diemetradon</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95197/therapsid-scale-gloves">
<img alt="Therapsid Scale Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_mail_raidhunter_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Therapsid Scale Gloves</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95166/forzarras-last-meal">
<img alt="Forzarra's Last Meal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_179.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Forzarra's Last Meal</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>The first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90911/furyheart-treads">
<img alt="Furyheart Treads" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Furyheart Treads</span></a>, a strong early pair of boots.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="galleon">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon</span></h3>Galleon drops a variety of powerful 496 item level gear, which will provide an even bigger boost to your character than most Celestial gear. Alongside a mount, the most interesting drops for Enhancement Shamans are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90437/hereditary-saurok-loop">
<img alt="Hereditary Saurok Loop" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_145.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hereditary Saurok Loop</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90453/girdle-of-the-raging-rider">
<img alt="Girdle of the Raging Rider" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_mail_raidhunter_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Girdle of the Raging Rider</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90432/hellriders-choker">
<img alt="Hellrider's Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_100.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hellrider's Choker</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90421/chain-of-unsiezed-skies">
<img alt="Chain of Unsiezed Skies" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_raidhunter_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chain of Unsiezed Skies</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90444/treads-of-gentle-nudges">
<img alt="Treads of Gentle Nudges" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_mail_raidhunter_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Treads of Gentle Nudges</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90413/crest-of-the-grand-warband">
<img alt="Crest of the Grand Warband" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_mail_dungeonmail_c_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crest of the Grand Warband</span></a>.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Reputation Items for Enhancement Shamans</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first. We recommend you prioritize the new Faction for Phase 3, <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1435/shado-pan-assault">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan Assault</span></a>, to be able to purchase high item level offpieces until you recieve your raiding gear.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="shado-pan-assault">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
